@3920. He is reformed so that he can subsist in the least of his evil.

@4037. When man is in the bodily life, he can be reformed. Explained.

@4038. But in the other life... they are not reformed. Explained.

@5694. They are vastated as to the gross externals... and thus reformed...

@6033. Man cannot be reformed by taking away these Societies...

