@--[2]. As God perceives... all the relatives in Heaven... and thereby perceives... all the opposite relatives in Hell...

@WE 1027[end]. For there to be anything there must be what is relative to contraries. @WE 1151[end].

@DMin 4743. All things are relatives; and without the perception of contraries there are no relatives...

Relative.; Respectivus.
Relatively.; Respective.

@AC 1582. Right and left are merely relative...

@1900[2]. Regard each other relatively as...

@2157. The deference of the Lord's state. Signified, Explained. @2158.

@5313[2]. Significations are circumstanced relatively.

@10265. Everything in the Word is to be understood relatively to that of which it is said.

@TCR 31. The infinity of God relatively to spaces... and relatively to times...

@447. The relative state of the spirit of man...

Relative Sense.; Sensus respectivus.

@AC 4207. Occurs. @4428. @4585[2]. @4981. @6363. @DLW 121. @AR 305. @344. @390.

Relax. See <"Loose, To"-Laxare>.

Release.; Manumittere. Manumissio.

@CL 267[3]. When such become Spirits, and are thus set free...

@370[end]. The concubines and wives are there released.

@TCR 434. The release of the imprisoned thoughts.

@815. Peoples not set free are like...

Relegate.; Relegare.

