@9480. The presence of the Lord in the Representative Church. Signified, Explained.

@9525. The worship of the Representative Church. Signified, Explained.

@9966. The laws of order in the Representative Church. Signified, Explained.

@10276. The influx and presence of the Lord in the worship of the Representative Church. Signified, Explained.

